{"title":"What should I ask Walter Isaacson?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/973549247/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Walter-Isaacson.html","date":1795200280000,"content":"<p>Yes I will be doing a Conversation with him, in part to celebrate the reissue of his earlier book <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Innovators-Hackers-Geniuses-Created-Revolution/dp/1476708703/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3NJAP33K99PS2&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.lkLGxjD8LlHYt4XySsg7L5pgN0Ao6_7nOjw5UpRDTFKYm5WjV9DDxIGPiqlO3vKPfngRyWqSnrKNBlcS51i7EkM_gf3HB4BhKFjSQZkGTWfxaKodL2WnOREzVLMv4Z5lFkCK4hKYg2rksO9w3VdEEbLWseVTNHDPcgjzblB3x2itJjOzA9uZwPepwzvv5_fmOFNWFpWLg-ctDbGmXu9GgplStGSb-uD5YXO4IxswIZY.9CZj5WMGvdogA24ZgUgO7aBAc12PX9XwiG5Q4xdb6Xk&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=The+Innovators%3A+How+a+Group+of+Hackers%2C+Geniuses%2C+and+Geeks+Created+the+Digital+Revolution&amp;nsdOptOutParam=true&amp;qid=1794964970&amp;sprefix=the+innovators+how+a+group+of+hackers%2C+geniuses%2C+and+geeks+created+the+digital+revolution%2Caps%2C139&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Innovators: How a Group of Hackers, Geniuses, and Geeks Created the Digital Revolution</a>.  And also to celebrate his new podcast, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.kaleidoscope.nyc/builders\" target=\"_blank\">The Builders</a>.</p>\r\n<p>He has <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/stores/Walter-Isaacson/author/B000APFLB8?ref=ap_rdr&amp;shoppingPortalEnabled=true&amp;ccs_id=ee06916f-3342-4055-8b50-af55e510a64b\" target=\"_blank\">other books too</a>!</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/what-should-i-ask-walter-isaacson.html\">What should I ask Walter Isaacson?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://margina